{"articleNo":"2953","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2953&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011-2학기 성적취소안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.09.02","hit":"15369","attachments":[{"name":"성적취소신청원2.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2953&attachNo=2078"},{"name":"붙임4] 폐지과목내역.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2953&attachNo=2724"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2011학년도 2학기 성적취소 안내</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2011. 9. 5(월) ~ 9. 6(화)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 신청장소 : 해당 종합학사행정실</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 제출서류 : 성적취소 신청원 1부</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -48pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">☞ 성적증명서 제출 생략관계로 정확한 성적취소 처리를 위해 신청원 작성시 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">교과목코드, 교과목명 정확히 작성 바람</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 신청방법 : 성적취소 신청원 작성→해당 종합학사행정실 제출</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 성적취소내역 확인 </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 일시 : 2011. 9. 16(금)부터~ (예정)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 확인방법 : 원스톱서비스 로그인-학적부-학적자료조회-성적정정/포기</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;바. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">성적취소 대상자 및 범위 </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -168.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 168.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 변경 전 : 매학기 6학점 이내</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -102.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 102.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 변경 후 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">7학기이상 이수하고 8학기이상 등록한 자에 한하여 6학점이내 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">(1회에 한함)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -43.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 43.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 단, 2009학년도 이전 입학자는 2010학년도 이후 최초 2개 재학학기에 한하여 변경 전의 규정을 적용하여 성적취소 가능.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -60pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 60pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;예시1) 2010학년도 1,2학기 재학은 했으나, 성적취소를 안했더라도 기회는 없음</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -76pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 76pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;예시2) 2010학년도 1,2학기는 휴학하고, 2011학년도 1,2학기 재학할 경우, 2011학년도 1,2학기 성적취소 신청 가능.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -60pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 60pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -30pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※&nbsp; 학사일정상의 성적취소 및 이수구분변경 기간인</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> 9. 28(수)～9. 30(금)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">도 추가로 별도 시행 </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -33pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-INDENT: -33pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">교무연구처장</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
